---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service | Knowletive" description="Knowletive terms of service governing website usage, program enrollment, and consulting services.">
  <section class="relative page-header-spacing pb-10 md:pb-12 bg-[#072B6F] text-white">
    <div class="container-custom text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-manrope font-extrabold mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-blue-100 text-sm md:text-base">Last updated: January 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-white">
    <div class="container-custom max-w-4xl text-[#0B1F3A] leading-relaxed space-y-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#072B6F]">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-[#64748B]">By accessing knowletive.com or registering for any of our educational programs, courses, or consulting sessions, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#072B6F]">2. Training & Certification</h2>
        <p class="text-[#64748B]">All course materials, live session recordings, and documentation provided by Knowletive are intellectual property reserved for enrolled students only. Unauthorized sharing, reproduction, or distribution is prohibited.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#072B6F]">3. Placement & Internship Assistance</h2>
        <p class="text-[#64748B]">Knowletive provides structured internship training, resume optimization, and placement referrals across our hiring partner network. While we maintain a high placement track record, final hiring decisions rest entirely with employer interview performance and eligibility criteria.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#072B6F]">4. Modifications & Cancellations</h2>
        <p class="text-[#64748B]">Knowletive reserves the right to modify batch timings, instructor allocations, or syllabus updates to reflect ongoing market trends without compromising training quality.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#072B6F]">5. Governing Law</h2>
        <p class="text-[#64748B]">These terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of Pune, Maharashtra, India.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
